{"id": "22-118-2-2", "zh": "省略类", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-119-2-21", "zh": "26. **元音** **省略** **在元音前**［ka.12；rū.13；nī.30］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-120-2-4", "zh": "被删去，所以叫作 lopa（省略）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-120-5-15", "zh": "后面接元音时，前面的元音，无论与后元音同类还是不同类，都要省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-121-2-4", "zh": "先说同类元音的情况——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-122-2-39", "zh": "a 类元音：lokaggo［apa.thera 1.12.57］、bhavāsavo［dha.sa.1102］、avijjāsavo［dha.sa.1102］、avijjānusayo［vibha.949］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-123-2-14", "zh": "i 类元音：munindo、munīrito、varavādīrito、itthindriyaṃ［vibha.219］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-124-2-24", "zh": "u 类元音：bahūpakāro［jā.1.22.588］；bahukā ūmi（许多波浪）成为 bahūmi；sarabhuyā ūmi（萨罗普河的波浪）成为 sarabhūmi；sarabhuyā udakaṃ（萨罗普河的水）成为 sarabhūdakaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-125-2-3", "zh": "不同类元音的情况——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-126-2-95", "zh": "sotindriyaṃ［vibha.219］、kāmupādānaṃ、bhavesanā［dī.ni.3.305］、bhavogho［dha.sa.1156］、so tuṇhassa［pārā.381］、diṭṭhānusayo［vibha.949］、diṭṭhupādānaṃ、diṭṭhekaṭṭhaṃ、diṭṭhogho［dha.sa.1156］、mudindriyaṃ［mahāva.9］、puttā matthi［dha.pa.62］、urassa dukkho［pāci.402］、asantettha na dissanti［dha.pa.304］等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-127-2-4", "zh": "以上是前元音省略类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-128-2-20", "zh": "27. **后面的（元音）** **有时**（省略）［ka.13；rū.15；nī.31］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-129-2-12", "zh": "在前面的元音之后，后面的元音，无论与前元音同类还是不同类，有时要省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-130-2-4", "zh": "先说同类元音的情况——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-131-2-151", "zh": "taṃ kadāssu bhavissati［jā.2.22.144 等；另作 taṃ kudassu］、kudāssu nāma dummedho, dukkhassantaṃ karissati［dha.pa.376］、yadāssa sīlaṃ paññañca［jā.2.22.1474］、tadāssu kaṇhaṃ yuñjanti［jā.1.1.29］——kaṇhaṃ 指大黑牛，taṇhāssa vippahīnā、māssu kujjha rathesabha、satthahārakaṃ vāssa pariyeseyya［pārā.167、171］、āgatāttha tumhe、sotukāmāttha tumhe、māyyo evarūpamakāsi、papaṃ avinduṃ［jā.1.1.2］——意思是得到了增长的水，nālaṃ kabaḷaṃ padātave［jā.1.1.27］——拆分为 pa + ādātave，意思是“去拿取”，ruppatīti rūpaṃ、bujjhatīti buddho——前元音变为长音，aggīva tappati、itthīva gacchati、nadīva sandati、mātupaṭṭhānaṃ、pitupaṭṭhānaṃ、yete dhammā ādikalyāṇā［cūḷava.399］等等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-132-2-3", "zh": "不同类元音的情况——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-133-2-103", "zh": "itissa［pāci.465］、itipi［pārā.1］、assamaṇīsi［pārā.135］、akataññūsi［dha.pa.383］、vandehaṃ、sohaṃ、yassadāni［mahāva.242］、chāyāva anapāyinī［dha.pa.2］、mādisesu kathāva kā、kinnumāva samaṇiyo、madhuvā maññati bālo［dha.pa.69］、cakkhundriyaṃ［vibha.219］、dveme bhikkhave dhammā［a.ni.2.3］、tayome bhikkhave dhammā［a.ni.3.17］等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-134-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-134-5-17", "zh": "例如：katamā cānanda aniccasaññā［a.ni.10.60］（这里不省略）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-135-2-4", "zh": "以上是后元音省略类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-136-2-8", "zh": "28. **两者** **不**（省略），**可选**。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-137-2-9", "zh": "前后两个元音有时可以不省略。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-138-2-23", "zh": "appamādo amataṃ padaṃ［dha.pa.21］、ko imaṃ pathaviṃ vicessati［dha.pa.44］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-139-2-3", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-139-4-17", "zh": "例如 sotindriyaṃ［vibha.219］、cakkhundriyaṃ［vibha.219］（这里仍要省略）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-140-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“可选”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-140-6-9", "zh": "例如：komaṃ vasaliṃ parāmasissati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-141-2-12", "zh": "从这里起，直到连声章结束，凡是适用的地方，kvaci 一词和 vā 一词都贯通沿用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-141-13-17", "zh": "其中，kvaci 一词表示用法因场合而不同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-141-18-22", "zh": "vā 一词表示同一个用法可以有不同的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-141-23-24", "zh": "以上是省略的禁止。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-142-2-6", "zh": "29. **后面元音的**（省略）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-143-2-8", "zh": "在鼻音 ṃ（niggahīta）之后，后面的元音有时可以省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-144-2-63", "zh": "tvaṃsi［pe.va.47；jā.2.22.764］、candaṃva vimalaṃ suddhaṃ［dha.pa.413；su.ni.642］、cakkaṃva vahato padaṃ［dha.pa.1］、halaṃdāni pakāsituṃ［mahāva.8］、kinti vadeyyaṃ、cīvaranti、pattanti、bhikkhunti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-145-2-4", "zh": "以上是元音省略类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-146-2-7", "zh": "30. **复辅音的首音** **省略**。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-147-2-9", "zh": "复辅音中处在首位的辅音，有时可以省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-148-2-55", "zh": "pupphaṃsā uppajjati［pārā.36］——这里按前一条规则省略元音；evaṃsa te āsavā pahīnā honti［ma.ni.1.24］；sace bhutto bhaveyyāhaṃ, sājīvo garahito mama［mi.pa.6.1.5］——拆分为 assa + ājīvo，assa 的意思是 bhaveyya。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-149-2-54", "zh": "三个辅音中，两个同类辅音的首辅音省略：agyāgāraṃ［pāci.326］、agyāhito、vutyassa、vityānubhūyate、ekasataṃ khatyā［jā.2.22.594］、ratyo、ratyā、ratyaṃ、sakvāhaṃ mārisa devānamindo［saṃ.ni.1.268］等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-150-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“同类”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-150-6-24", "zh": "例如：titthyā puthuso vadanti［su.ni.897］、catutthyantaṃ、chaṭṭhuntaṃ、cakkhvābādhaṃ、vatthvettha（这些不省略）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-151-2-4", "zh": "以上是辅音省略类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-152-2-6", "zh": "31. **省略**。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-153-2-7", "zh": "鼻音 ṃ 有时可以省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-154-2-5", "zh": "先说后面接元音的情况——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-155-2-95", "zh": "evāhaṃ cintayitvāna［bu.vaṃ.2.27］、pupphadānaṃ adāsahaṃ——拆分为 adāsiṃ + ahaṃ，先省略鼻音，再省略前面的元音；tuyhatthāya mahāmuni、tuyhevetaṃ dukkaṭaṃ［dī.ni.2.178］、tāsāhaṃ santike［pāci.709］、tesāhaṃ evaṃ vadāmi、pañcannetaṃ dhammānaṃ adhivacanaṃ、channetaṃ dhammānaṃ adhivacanaṃ、samaṇa tveva pucchāmi［jā.2.22.253 作 samaṇa teva］、brāhmaṇa tveva pucchāmi［jā.2.22.258 作 brāhmaṇa teva］——拆分为 tvaṃ + eva，vidūnaggamiti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-156-2-4", "zh": "后面接辅音的情况——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-157-2-5", "zh": "taṃ tuyhamūle paṭidesemi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-158-2-3", "zh": "在偈颂中——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-159-2-38", "zh": "ariyasaccānadassanaṃ［khu.pā.5.11］、etaṃ buddhāna sāsanaṃ［dha.pa.183］、khandhānañca paṭipāṭi, dhātuāyatanāna ca［dha.sa.aṭṭha. 因缘论］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-160-2-4", "zh": "后面接增音 m 的情况——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-161-2-81", "zh": "garuḷo uragāmiva［jā.1.4.124 作 supaṇṇo］、dhammo arahatāmiva［dī.ni.2.348］、āloko passatāmiva［su.ni.769］、bako kakkaṭakāmiva［jā.1.1.38］、nabhaṃ tārakitāmiva［jā.2.22.1989 作 tārācitāmiva］、padumaṃ hatthagatāmiva［jā.2.22.2336］——这些例子中，在增音 m 前省略鼻音，并且在辅音前把前面的元音变为长音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-162-2-6", "zh": "同样，前缀 saṃ 省略鼻音后，末尾的元音变为长音——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-163-2-21", "zh": "sārāgo、sāratto、avisāhāro、sārambho、sāraddho、sāketaṃ nagaraṃ、sādhāraṇaṃ；“他有自己的财物（saṃ）”，所以叫 sāmī（主人）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-164-2-5", "zh": "在复合词中，以 tuṃ 结尾的词则一律省略——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-165-2-6", "zh": "kattukāmo、gantukāmo 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-166-2-4", "zh": "以上是鼻音省略类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-167-2-7", "zh": "32. **si 等格尾的省略** **在前一个词上**。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-168-2-11", "zh": "表示逐一（vicchā）时，一个带格尾的词重叠以后，前一个词的 si 等格尾要省略。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-169-2-10", "zh": "ekekaṃ、ekekāni、ekekena、ekekassa 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-170-2-3", "zh": "有增音 m 的情况——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-171-2-6", "zh": "ekamekaṃ、ekamekāni 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-172-2-4", "zh": "以上是格尾省略类。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-173-2-3", "zh": "下面讲一些零散的规定。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-174-2-37", "zh": "33. **tadaminā 等**［caṃ.5.2.1.27；pā.6.3.109；mu.2.34；kā.2.27］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-175-2-10", "zh": "这是一条大通则规则，意思是：tadaminā 等词形，都依这种特例规定（nipātana）而成立。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-176-2-4", "zh": "在辅音前省略元音——", "confidence": 70}
